Deployed model: EfficientNetV2-B0 224px (fine-tuned) (val macro-F1 0.8194)
# Model comparison
Test set: 837 X-rays, patient-disjoint from train/val. 95% bootstrap confidence intervals in brackets. p = McNemar test vs the best model.
**Best model = EfficientNetV2-B0 224px (fine-tuned)**, chosen by validation macro-F1 (0.819) among fine-tuned models, so the test set played no part in the choice.
