## Calibration (EfficientNetV2-B0 224px (fine-tuned))
Temperature fitted on validation: **T = 0.98**. Accuracy is unchanged; only confidence changes.
| | ECE ↓ |
|---|---|
| Before | 0.050 |
| After temperature scaling | 0.048 |
![reliability](figures/reliability_best.png)
## Selective prediction ("refer to radiologist")
Confidence threshold chosen on validation to reach 90% accuracy on answered cases: **0.70**.
On test the model answers **73.1%** of X-rays with **88.1%** accuracy (vs 81.8% if forced to answer everything); the other 26.9% are flagged for human review.
